  "experiments": [
    "First geometry candidate passed 237/348; linear routes and controls raised this to 308/350.",
    "A rigid-hop port passed 329/350. Direct per-hop captures isolated the remaining FK4 and HADEC signs. A casacore 3.7.1 C++ probe reproduced CASA and traced the direct APP FK4 mismatch to MeasMath::applyETerms default epoch argument 2000.0.",
    "The 0.142 nT IGRF residual came from decimal-year interpolation instead of MeasTable::IGRF fractional MJD. The 0.203 mm Earth-radius position residual traced to the moment LAST is rounded by MCFrame::getLASTr. Both corrected before recapture.",
    "Running the old CASA capture on the bundled snapshot showed three failures (up to 0.0186 m). CASA with the same bundled snapshot removes those test-input mismatches at the original tolerances."
  ],
